# automation/ai_loop/workspace/ — runtime scratch area (Issues #1105-#1107).
#
# Everything generated at runtime here (synthesized candidates, rejected-candidate archives,
# backtest-run artifacts, the Path-A search-space-override candidate JSON) is transient AI-Loop
# output and MUST NOT be committed. Only the directory skeleton (.gitkeep placeholders) and this
# file are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!**/.gitkeep
